                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5cdb37da-44e8-3407-8a5f-ed02c6915d5a",
                        "entry_id": "8527d69a-0555-3097-b745-dcd725372267",
                        "glosses": [
                            "узел системы питания двигателя внутреннего сгорания системы Отто, предназначенный для подготовки горючей смеси оптимального состава путём смешивания жидкого топлива с воздухом и регулирования количества её подачи в камеры сгорания двигателя"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b08f86f8-7a9c-4c5a-a2ea-6bbde85d8354",
                                "sense_id": "5cdb37da-44e8-3407-8a5f-ed02c6915d5a",
                                "text": "Пропорции жидкостей не сходились, подержанный агрегат барахлил, и Николай Тарасович, посылая проклятья изобретателю двухтактного двигателя, снова разбирал мотор, отлаживал магнето, чистил карбюратор, опорожнял бак и заливал новую смесь ― и так, пока «Тайга» не начала кудахтать с первого рывка заводного троса."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "11c6f710-6132-4b02-ac79-939d39a72b4b",
                        "source_entry_id": "8527d69a-0555-3097-b745-dcd725372267",
                        "source_sense_id": "5cdb37da-44e8-3407-8a5f-ed02c6915d5a",
                        "target_lang_word": "carburettor",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "carburettor",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4150c0fe-443c-327c-a14e-7acf7c052cf2",
                                        "entry_id": "aedf7911-a9b3-36e6-9946-5cf4ffd20c4f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of carburetor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9183a9ab-ce18-4c3e-9ca1-1f3eeeab9073",
                                                "sense_id": "4150c0fe-443c-327c-a14e-7acf7c052cf2",
                                                "text": "Both affect the performance of the machine, especially the carburettors, and both are important to the final appearance of the model."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4483902-d063-4a16-895e-e755fbe198e3",
                                                "sense_id": "4150c0fe-443c-327c-a14e-7acf7c052cf2",
                                                "text": "In a carburettor the pressure drop (or viewed another way, suction) is used to draw fuel out of a reservoir, usually via a jet, and into the venturi to mix with the air flowing through it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4ab6083-be59-4cc9-939b-81c3a527e878",
                                                "sense_id": "4150c0fe-443c-327c-a14e-7acf7c052cf2",
                                                "text": "For a large part of the twentieth century the majority of light vehicles used petrol engines that were equipped with a carburettor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "628bb393-a6d2-45e2-b618-59746840d936",
                        "source_entry_id": "8527d69a-0555-3097-b745-dcd725372267",
                        "source_sense_id": "5cdb37da-44e8-3407-8a5f-ed02c6915d5a",
                        "target_lang_word": "carburetor",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "carburetor",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4266ca02-d6d1-3eb6-a353-7fcc231bcf9f",
                                        "entry_id": "ecece2f0-1c1f-3595-b6c9-095d77158a35",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device in an internal combustion engine where fuel is vaporized and mixed with air prior to ignition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada",
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a49b11f5-ec8b-4991-b898-ff5036114bc6",
                                                "sense_id": "4266ca02-d6d1-3eb6-a353-7fcc231bcf9f",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: gasifier"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae1f639d-bf07-3d04-91be-418ab501177a",
                                        "entry_id": "ecece2f0-1c1f-3595-b6c9-095d77158a35",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device for enhancing illuminating gas by mixing in carbon-rich fuel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2fa9561-0445-4181-8f09-ab44c01f490d",
                                                "sense_id": "ae1f639d-bf07-3d04-91be-418ab501177a",
                                                "text": "Second, the employment of a current of air between the carburettor and the tube leading to the burner, is described.\nThe Mechanics' Magazine, July 25, 1862."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f457fd48-85e6-3ca5-8f50-e52b97c9efed",
                                        "entry_id": "ecece2f0-1c1f-3595-b6c9-095d77158a35",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A water pipe or bong; a device or contrivance for mixing air with burning cannabis or cocaine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6adcff2-f388-4fd9-878f-c0e4191568ec",
                                                "sense_id": "f457fd48-85e6-3ca5-8f50-e52b97c9efed",
                                                "text": "Variations on the bong included air-driven pipes, electric pipes, ice pipes (chillers), mask pipes, chamber pipes, and carburetor pipes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbd448f1-6a6c-47cd-83da-ede0b4df07e2",
                                                "sense_id": "f457fd48-85e6-3ca5-8f50-e52b97c9efed",
                                                "text": "Some pipes feature a “carburetor,” which is a small hole in the air chamber located past the bowl. The carburetor is held shut while the bowl is being lit and the smoke drawn."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
